WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.470
- So you, you had some health issues,

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:02.303
but you're doing well, right?

00:00:02.303 --> 00:00:03.136
- I did.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.810
Right about this time, last year.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.400
- Yeah, literally.
- I was in the hospital.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.820
I went in for one thing, ended
up having surgery for five.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.693
So it was buy one, get four free.

00:00:13.693 --> 00:00:15.060
- [Kelly] Oh my...

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:15.990
That's scary.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.120
- No, it was really a
very scary time, Kelly.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.260
It was a very scary time

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.110
and Al is one who likes to
look forward, not backward.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:23.580
- Oh, the optimist.
- Which is great,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:24.413
ever the optimist.

00:00:24.413 --> 00:00:26.070
But it was a very, very difficult time

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:28.110
and we are so blessed to have him

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.961
in full form and just great.

00:00:29.961 --> 00:00:31.147
(audience applauding)

00:00:31.147 --> 00:00:33.390
- But I have to say
too, your granddaughter,

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:34.471
she kind of played a role, right?

00:00:34.471 --> 00:00:35.304
- Yes, yeah.

00:00:35.304 --> 00:00:37.650
I found out while I was in the
hospital that my oldest girl,

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.487
Courtney, was expecting
our first grandchild.

00:00:40.487 --> 00:00:41.898
- Aw!
- And there she is.

00:00:41.898 --> 00:00:43.260
Little Sky.
- Look!

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.872
- Oh, you can all go, "Aw!"
- I know.

00:00:46.872 --> 00:00:48.537
So special.

00:00:48.537 --> 00:00:50.070
- But I think more than anything else,

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.770
I think just knowing
that she was coming along

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:54.330
over this last year.
- Exactly.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:55.740
- Because it's been a progression,

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.480
but you've just gotten
stronger and stronger

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.313
and so here he is.

00:00:58.313 --> 00:01:00.960
So now when he drops his underwear

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.430
and his stuff on the floor or whatever

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:03.840
and I wanna get upset with him,

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.700
I'm just like, you know?
- They're there.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.170
- I could have been dead.

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.370
- Oh my God, he's gonna use it.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:09.480
That's gonna be his card.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.800
- He's like, "This is
what you prayed for!"

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:11.670
- It's your fault.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.380
You saved me, sorry!

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:15.513
- You didn't want me to go anywhere.

